                ],
                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "MODE SWITCH group (shipped #632, written back): the Hold-for-FX toggle governs the pedal's Mode switch only. Off (default) a press cycles Record \u2192 Mute \u2192 FX and holding arms performance recording. On, a press cycles Record \u2194 Mute, holding enters FX at the long-press threshold and a second hold (or a tap) returns to the mode FX was entered from; the hold-to-arm gesture yields, so performance recording stays on the toolbar and keyboard. Keyboard M and the on-screen mode chip always cycle all three modes regardless of the toggle."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
